        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogosarigwa kwa Yerusalemu gokobanwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro amang’an’Omonene arentete ase Yeremia, ekero Zedekia omorwoti amotomerete Pasuri, mosinto o Malikia, na Zefania Omokuani, mosinto o Maaseya, bakamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gaki kwana n’Omonene ribaga riaito, ekiagera Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni, ngocha are gotorwania esegi; ande Omonene nabo arabaise gotokorera amakumia aye, erinde omorwoti oyio atotige tatorwania.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeremia akabairaneria, “Teebia Zedekia",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng’a aya nar’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Naama! Ebirwanero ebio mobwate ase amaboko aino korwaneria omorwoti o Babiloni na Abakalidayo, abwo baabanaaririe isiko ye chindwaki, inche omonyene nimbionchore na mbisangererie amo gati‐gati y’omochie oyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche omonyene mbarwanie inwe nokoboko kwane kore ne chinguru, imbe nendamwamu, na obotindi, na okogechigwa okonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ning’ite abanto abamenyete ase omochie oyio, ng’ite ne ching’iti chireo. Oborwaire bogoita mboite Mwanyabaanto ne ching’iti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Omonene oteebire, “Magega y’ayio nimbeke Zedekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, na abasomba baye, na abanto b’omochie oyo, baria bataitwe noborwaire, gose nemioro, gose nenchara, mbabeeke ase okoboko kwa Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni, na ase amaboko ’ababisa babo. Abwo bakorigia obogima bwabo. Takobarorera amabeebe, gose kobatiga mobe moyo, gose kobarorera amaabera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Otebie abanto aba ng’a aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Rora, nabekire ase amasio aino enchera y’obogima na ey’amakweri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto orabeere ase omochie oyo ime naitwe nemioro, na enchara, na oborwaire; korende oyorasoke korwa imeo na kwerua ase amaboko ’Abakalidayo, abwo banaaretie omochie, oyio nere orabe moyo, na tabaisa goitwa ase esegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche naonchoire obosio bwane korwania omochie oyo, tinkoyororera amaabera, korende ninyorentere amabe. Nobekwe ase okoboko kw’omorwoti o Babiloni, nere ayosambe nomorero.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okogambigwa kw’enyomba y’omorwoti bw’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwana nabaanto b’enyomba y’omorwoti bw’Abayuda, obateebie: Igwa ring’ana ri’Omonene,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inwe abanto b’ororeria rwa Daudi. Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Mobe mokonacha ekiina kia boronge kera emambia; omonto oria ourererigwe momorusie ase okoboko kw’omochandi oye. Motakoreti bo, endamwamu yane enga buna omorero ogosamba nayoke, na onde takoyerimia. Ayio nakoreke ase engencho y’ogokora kwaino okobe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abanto momenyete ase rikura, nainwe abamomenyete ase amabwago ’ebitare bi’omweya, inche nabangire. Nabo inche Omonene natebiire. Inwe nigo mogokwana iga: Ning’o oranyare gotirimboka gocha aa gotorwania, gose ning’o oranyare gosoa aa ase tomenyete?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche nimbae egesusuro koreng’ana nokwama kw’ogokora kwaino. Nabo inche Omonene natebiire. Nintongie omorero ase rinani ri’omochie oyio, ninsambe ebinto bionsi biyoetanaine.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
